<body><p><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">The </span><a href="https://www.versnellingsplan.nl/Kennisbank/learning-community-tool/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px; color: inherit"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Learning Community Tool</span></span></a><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">is a clear and insightful tool for developing co-creation. </span><span style="margin: 0px">This tool suggests, among other things, scheduling weekly team meetings, creating a mixed community based on five design principles, and using concrete and existing collaboration tools—TRAIL also offers inspiration for this.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></body>
